    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I got this girl and she wants me to duke her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I told her I'll come scoop her around eight, she said, \"(Super!)",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "That sounds great!\" Shorty girl's a trooper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "No matter what I need her to do, she be like: (\"Super!\")",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Own his own throne, the boss like King Koopa",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "On the microphone he flossed the ring (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Average emcees is like a TV blooper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "MF DOOM, he's like D.B. Cooper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Out with the moolah, I let her get a outfit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Just to cool her off, she said, \"Niggas ain't about shit\"",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I wonder if she meant it, I doubt it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "The way it be in her mouth, she can't live without it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And can't live with this, handle yo' business",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Villainous stay on a scandalous ho's shit list",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "\"One pack of cookies, please, Mr. Hooper\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "It's fun smacking rookies, he is the (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Look like a Black Wookiee when he let his beard grow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Weirdo, brown skinned-ed, always kept his hair low",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Rumors has it it's a S-Curl accident",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "DOOM was always known to keep the best girls' backs bent",
          "rhyme": "yRb",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Some say it's the eyes, some say the accent",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "A lot of guys wonder where their stacks went",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "I call her Thunder-Thighs with the fatty swoll-uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Only mess with high rollers, do what Daddy told her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "No matter the city, she with me to do the thang-thang",
          "rhyme": "#g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Workin' the coochie, hoopty Chitty Chitty Bang Bang",
          "rhyme": "#g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Same name on the titty as on the name ring",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Pretty like Baby D off \"All in the Same Gang\"",
          "rhyme": "#g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Keep my eye on her, really don't trust her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "But I treat her like a daughter, taught her how to bust a nut",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "And the heat to turn beef to horsemeat chalupa",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Teach her how to hold it, of course, he is the (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "See, most cats treat her like Foofur",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Or beat her to a stupor, take it from the (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "You need to make her feel cuter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "And lay down the G like loofah, everything'll be (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "ab",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Do for her, keep her in a new fur",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "So she look sweet when she go to meet the (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Got the buddha, get the Grenadiers–twist it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Put it in the air, come here, kiss it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Listen here, scooter, let her try to bag you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "When she's on the rag, never let her fry the ragù",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Witch'll have you under some type of spell crying, \"Dag, boo\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Her name on your back in a tattoo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Whether a bougie broad, nerd ho, street chick",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Don't call her Wifey if you met her at the Freaknik",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "You don't want her? Don't waste her time, I'll duke her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "And be a father to your child, like the (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "He keep his ho's in check",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "Sends 'em out to get glows from off frozen necks",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Tell 'em, \"Take his clothes, leave him posin' naked for real",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "Better yet, get him for the check off the record deal",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "Find out where he keep the TEC and the blue steel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "Make sure for extra wreck, let him know how you feel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "And while he's running down to All-Star Weekend to ball",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "I'm coming with the U-Haul\" (Super!)",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
