      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(DOOM): Has the laser cannon been loaded?",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "(DOOM Crony): Everything has been prepared as you ordered. But how did you get permission to return to New York, Master?",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "(DOOM): Through the efforts of a misguided... fool",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "(J. Jonah Jameson): It's free enterprise! And I'm not gonna let some blasted government bureaucrat tell me how to run my business!",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(Jameson Employee): But DOOM—",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "(J. Jonah Jameson): Will be my guest on my private estate on Long Island! There's nothing you can do about it!",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "(Jameson Employee): He's dangerous, I just hope you know what you're doing",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "(J. Jonah Jameson): Don't I always? Ah, there's DOOM's jet! Right on time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "(Peter Parker): Why is it so cold down here?",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "(Robbie Robertson): Uh–the heat went out in the whole building",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "(Betty Brant): Warm enough out there on Long Island with DOOM",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "(Peter Parker): DOOM? Here in New York?!",
          "rhyme": "ORk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "(Robbie Robertson): Yes, DOOM, has an amazing new machine...",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "(DOOM): Get the president of the United States on the phone",
          "rhyme": "on",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "(J. Jonah Jameson): How long is all this gonna take, DOOM?",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "(DOOM): I would not advise you to repeat that error",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "(J. Jonah Jameson): Sure... I know what you mean",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
